note: internal/alpha is a split entry; move carries only move and merge entries and file move entries
note: internal/alpha/split.go is a split file entry; move carries only file move entries
note: migration/platform/beta/renamed.go carries a package comment, but in migration/platform/beta only doc.go may (decision 0044)
regenerate: make fmt (format the changed files)
dry run: nothing changed
